                <head>Military service agreement between the United States and the
                    Netherlands</head>
                <p>[The agreement was effected by exchanges of notes signed at Washington March 31,
                    July 2, and September 24 and 30, 1942. For text of notes, see Department of
                    State Executive Agreement Series No. 306, or 56 Stat. (pt. 2) 1900.]</p>
            </div>
